{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1519,
  "batch_count": 1689,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "4c77e29d79c031b121c5d2d0a53ce8b0070eb9a1",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06ea2582f45d945c486d73dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先人たちの記憶を継いだ、栄光の結晶。\r\n今こそ示そう――我が脚、我が力ッ！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "083fdb5d393b469618c8fe50cbb0466cfa748ff14eada4b707077b196488ceb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "40001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5d4bee1d592e4abb96e5aff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "是活动任务。如果需要\r\n帮助的话请别客气。\r\n对我而言这也算是一种训练。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c946f4a4d13adf2fe5ecbca96b340eec41a3ad6d61ed77e0dc96c60dba99d0e2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da452db0a51434b55a338e47",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务奖励……这是努力的证明，\r\n也可说是迈向最强所留下的蹄迹。\r\n让我们逐一好好体味吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf3c1b5ff901ce3bccc8887155517b8f7ace0099ce7c508de5eaaff0c222879e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df01af82f201e54acdcbd5a5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "那个VR温泉乒乓球……  \n居然还要计算球台的磨损来决定战术……  \n如果还有机会的话，我会征服世界。",
      "source_fingerprint": "846fbb9e8f4b1e8e2844757b35f0ea573930a54bae0a696c65d53dd6056366f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400113"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34ff1ded7ee506a0d23af5c7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "模拟店，绝对要办得红红火火才行。\r\n说到人气兴旺……甜点、拉面……\r\n唔，还有……小熊猫……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4270570c6940d6cc086cf10937e0df8131355a1738cb6253ce6016871a6a83c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400144"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a1c77c3994446059454c4f3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吸引观众的演技，我已经渐渐掌握要领了。\r\n对于每晚陪我练习的皇冠，\r\n真得好好感谢她才行。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8f0ac618ce94971ecbafc6b653431a4eb857be90947e7dd6cf9373d832b29de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "400145"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1faf808ed450456ef91b50ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "威風堂々、最強らしく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "28bcde03fa0e40e885972b2c7577eb60e06a3c75a0566615cded0ab5175e449e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "60000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:368017a2eea740dc4d669bd0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "完璧にこなしてみせよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "81176f90b006487f772a92297e069c3ff5cc3784897dec3facf5a5a2eda126bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "60001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c5adca8617fb2e5dcf4e0ee",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "証明しよう、“最強”を。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3faa9bd96227d06b0502e656662aa40beebab5d5c58a0fbff224effb86a144c9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:03caa891c8d1e84610ea7544",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "――まだ、緊張はする。\r\nけれど、気負いすぎはしない。\r\n気づかせてくれてありがとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f9568a7781bf5d4f4125e8949f04607839a1e3dca1c453523de487ce451b595",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8abd643235352e2f70c7fb93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着こなしは正しく、清潔に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98bb472798e7e951c459e90e766c4c64f581d306318030af4f4e86ada46d79fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cbd48916351cde4ff8aca0e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パフォーマンスに抜かりはない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad5f4780b54a91f10026f01211229c97167b57aae167528647df025d44fad1c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa5d84e1a44fcd461e958905",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この決意のように、\r\n揺るぎない黒を纏い――いざ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7327f778bf6cff524b30dd8b5c153ac5b6397077b5fae46f45b9008a0edc54a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ae02a981fbce94b53a2565",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生の本分に努めよう。\r\n文武両道、完璧に――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff313be344a90dc452ba5bf25cd752592fdbc9dab1acc7b34e8e5b500f93ee34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:93b16a591f3ab0b9047e59a2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台もひとつの団体競技――\r\n揃いの衣装を見ると、そう思う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "602d4bb3d9daee9f390c0543ae5dbc990fbd3e905b6b40e513d1e8c0e1763fea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:afa9af60e4dc883458fbf01f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“最強”を示そう。\r\n血の証明を、ここに…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ceeb83bb3b623040544b43c25f976a525ae7caf8564a49fc6965e13126841fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa45db8a1e518d338c274bdb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こういうものもあるのか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "760301284f5ed4b52e871f87f0e4a39b95b7a0638582896a9996f69191ae26cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef93e58d41211025a177827f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんな時も、場に相応しい装いを心掛けたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32087af23f38620cf6fc294e336ac9da0a7865387352cbe06eb0133cf405b382",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb00f8d06c9faf9cbc9983c2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这家厂商的衣服穿起来很舒服。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b06a77df0f229019b841e4d1c867f6fcfa200636a103bfdd960bb3af15bc9269",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5a72f5af702468d49f027c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "裤子要买长一点的……  \n因为裤腿很快就会变短。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9a0b3d5dc31a04053f40ccd27516d7118bc20bfe5b64380141fcc365a14f6ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:80545fbd8a88e40a01bd181b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着こなしは正しく、清潔に。",
      "source_fingerprint": "98bb472798e7e951c459e90e766c4c64f581d306318030af4f4e86ada46d79fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aef4293f8fba8c96b26987ec",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "パフォーマンスに抜かりはない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad5f4780b54a91f10026f01211229c97167b57aae167528647df025d44fad1c7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cf4144c223451d627455b8b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この決意のように、\r\n揺るぎない黒を纏い――いざ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7327f778bf6cff524b30dd8b5c153ac5b6397077b5fae46f45b9008a0edc54a9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0c8412e0e088b66cefb09962",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "学生の本分に努めよう。\r\n文武両道、完璧に――",
      "source_fingerprint": "ff313be344a90dc452ba5bf25cd752592fdbc9dab1acc7b34e8e5b500f93ee34",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0aa920a55ec1e019297699fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "舞台もひとつの団体競技――\r\n揃いの衣装を見ると、そう思う。",
      "source_fingerprint": "602d4bb3d9daee9f390c0543ae5dbc990fbd3e905b6b40e513d1e8c0e1763fea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa983c7c2651d39b9965f4dc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "“最強”を示そう。\r\n血の証明を、ここに…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ceeb83bb3b623040544b43c25f976a525ae7caf8564a49fc6965e13126841fc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6dbf6c8ab1c6b112b1112be3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こういうものもあるのか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "760301284f5ed4b52e871f87f0e4a39b95b7a0638582896a9996f69191ae26cb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe954c796dead780ed84dfb8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "どんな時も、場に相応しい装いを心掛けたいな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32087af23f38620cf6fc294e336ac9da0a7865387352cbe06eb0133cf405b382",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f10c69e03ff329b64230bf1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "お疲れ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "54a1d214d43ee0b5d0d4e2fcc8635216d1cab73d4202461d20226feba3d604eb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1dc7af77e5b494ceb8b35ff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝はスムージーをよく作る。\r\n1度に栄養を摂取できるし…多少\r\n口に合わないものでも、飲める。",
      "source_fingerprint": "70dd328f6aa62ea64de0f588843546634984433d32cf112226bbf96f2d775f36",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4594da0dd36924204294aaa6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早朝ランニングをしていると、必ず\r\n学園の誰かが努力をしている。…陽\r\nと共に闘志も昇る。負けられないな",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f852ce48d29bcffccaf0235952c443518d090ff3d039c55008954a2ee92cc5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6cd0efb0d2056362843ef6ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "カフェテリアは、有意義な時間を\r\n過ごせるな。先ほどもプロテインの\r\n新商品に関する体験談が聞こえた。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0faef1b7de19ba7cd6173188afd6563f37c3f950d1ec3230de20fcee135faee9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:660943a71d1d6f7d94393529",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "授業中、寝てしまった子は起こす。\r\n貴重な学びの機会を、睡魔によって\r\n逃してしまうのはもったいない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "21291580824911d97116af894134906ac751fb714c8d833a5941df7bbfb753fa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0208a74c9b8ae939df7b0f2a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "柔軟は念入りに行ってから\r\n眠りにつく。特に、脚は…\r\n明日も、存分に走りこめるように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "348fa34645fd8581f86582cc9524a6135577b1c6239bdcf412b0229a5ffb7832",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:385e4afa8921e701fb1f72c0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "質のいい睡眠のため、寝る前は\r\nイヤホンでクラシックを聴く。\r\n…たまに、切り忘れて朝になる…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "170ba34de6146443d66839b67298b2ada702b2f976d8cce4c3057f7757ee9b5e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12c283c5b132cd56c5752e5b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "選抜レースの季節だ。\r\n今年の傑物の噂は聞いている…\r\n私も負けるわけには、いかない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "22e7db818ce7e9d21c35ce5ab7a618eb62f2480d0ccbd9d77251046ba1f8fa17",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:07481a0745e58afe7ff26500",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "走るのに向かない、この季節は\r\n好きではなかったが…祭りの季節。\r\nキタサンの言葉で、見方が変わった",
      "source_fingerprint": "3052fc71d97d96e951d1d08d12fdfcb7f43b5446612fb72867bb7331c524533e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc30dfdcceccf04f12f4a501",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "読書で知識を深め、芸術で教養を\r\n身につける。…蓄えるのも大切な\r\n時間だ。もどかしいだけではない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c48a2cf03e01376d7edf763a4b67829298cf9576a199510e091843b95c86c92e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27651263967712c43032add7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬は筋肉が強張りやすい。今年も\r\n温泉に行くか…湯上りに卓球をして\r\nもうひとっ風呂、それを3セットだ",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad2061bd5e970a59c8e025b40d8b0a46b45b8f10a27ce84f555c034152211c39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f0e6b2ec7a09b048f06ef43",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "バレンタイン、だな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dadd5ed4fef6c2e6e6efa573f5582443f7a55250e4ef975016b8c8ba16dcf043",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58610aa520442214d2b4cdbf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "グル姉の花壇が好きだ。\r\n育つ植物を見守る彼女は、\r\n本当に優しい顔をしているから。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b3531a85f90aa6d122e0ae1f125ff63f174013370cbc1476ef363cf7dfd069",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:553a4c4a65ed0bcf446c9683",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "クラウンのおかげで、英語の勉強は\r\nとても捗っている。彼女のように\r\n堂々と話せるよう、一層励みたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c0d1cfdc1c802b8640a853239e13ab73dc4fbc34e187bc5d15d46575205611fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aca9962d805ab45a1833e5d3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "空からカワカミが降ってきた。\r\n理由は全くもって不明だが…\r\n抱きとめられて、よかった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fcfdb49bc942bd825a69b5b18e134f8346100cb94361b8c7e83018a86580583f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47332d7f12ffdb3c41febbf6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ハスカップ、というものを\r\nタルマエから勧められた。栄養の\r\n資料と共に…抜かりがないな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "11d82c1c9975ada61ae119828023c6f3f99355a9ca1aeb4fec2409d5db6661b9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e672fa1beb1816a3a11a9b7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "こうしている間も、ふと気づけば\r\n脳裏にはターフが浮かんでくる。\r\n目の前のウマ娘をどう抜くべきか…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7be73ff8be7e5fddb08f6c1663f971b8150237e1170294fcbcb4d8c04ef15b58",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:26dab5493eb037db52fe3989",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ファンの応援は力になる…\r\nその通りだと今、実感している。\r\n指先まで感謝を込め、踊りたい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "194b7955fc38776a19d389f588b3c2d6148e57b24d79a63f0e592ef177527a01",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:edd7c731d566df254b10ed8d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "華のある衣装だ。白はあまり\r\n着ないが、清廉で明るい印象が\r\nある。…たまには、悪くない。",
      "source_fingerprint": "347716426865a9b115903bab11a4c769ea8f3baae80e2b0adae9d3abc17db4aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:088b841549447c8a0494b775",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "肩の羽は、飛翔を願い――グル姉の\r\n意匠を借りた。品位と強さを備えた\r\nウマ娘に、私もなれるように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "038385fe5cddb319319a14a59dafafa3c2677515612e7a53f5d75a55d4ba99ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3f16f7ef1fbd5ee4728b2d5e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ブーツの意匠には、意味がある。\r\n強さと、絆――私が重んじるものだ",
      "source_fingerprint": "60918f652453d58a06f3896e15a732e82eea4fc8173656335de2e3be76ca5525",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7036d14fae9c382a2da3f7d2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早晨。…と、クラウンが時々\r\n寝ぼけながら、広東語で話してくる\r\n意味はおはよう…気になって調べた",
      "source_fingerprint": "18a6a075e7ac83fa28311bc12978f2d72199e8c8319ca74e77a7cd10baff8ec6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:942f68996597e42096bcfa9b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "レース理論のレポートが、指定\r\n枚数に収まらない…。仕掛けに\r\nついて、もっと語りたいのだが…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d1d309545f0975a10da48183c001727e567cb0514c53d3b2caffe8e115129cf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:14897c39d84a0761e54e78a9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強に相応しい勝負をしよう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "57985b33ccb88005628a2fdb62c0b7932eda867f3d4fe716ec023fb6dcc26ca1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "910100"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a74d1aa42f66db331519f49",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "1日の終わりに、己を省みる。\r\n完璧にできたか、やり残しはないか\r\n――この血に恥じぬ私であれたか。",
      "source_fingerprint": "15ad8a526687e893100bb775b2526b9ae4b2f50238d4362c9769ab32177e11b4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c344a9a9a06201f213d5f82c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "本格化を迎えたウマ娘たちの\r\nお披露目会に行ってきた。――私も\r\nあれほど、初々しかったのだろうか",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b0b93682361edbe01629c4bb1f1b33e95fe300521f0909bf6a91c14514adece",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f029d4c047a58875f59b0ff6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高地トレーニングに行こうと思う。\r\n涼しく、負荷が高く――\r\n頂からの、景色もいい。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3db039fd6f393343f802a75f45c1f86d86672ef55d912cd096eef1a6db86291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b084ee9afddac2f97a875f62",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "物悲しい季節だ――理由は、\r\nわからないが…じっとしていると、\r\nなんだか心がざわつく。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a2ab7e324391aec6c5695461b534c37deb4b05e137f8fa31547dcfbaf0a8b98d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12fe8aa36e4f548100e4f093",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "姉たちとの雪だるま作りは、競争\r\nだった。誰が1番大きな雪玉を\r\n作れるか…重ねるのが大変だった。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ade669442a77f48a548dd5f96b4caad06bc5eaec733e3d084c80c8fe0e6bea6a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7954f0f02cfcbefd3302f9e0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "始めよう。\r\n――誰よりも強くあるために。",
      "source_fingerprint": "887a43182be08a0d7f12003c6c191e641c30637ecf0c65091da3fa1a81579f95",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c488ea7748569ee54ccf80ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "勝利を――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e03d3b7cfa315bcede943062fc68307ffa104710f46050a594d84281c973d8f2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e66abc5012fdef5e63bc5d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "最強に至る道は見えている。\r\nあとは、着実に\r\n踏みしめていくのみ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7d104896cb6430d9344edf921622868683fc7b534b4a57714c4db7bc86a3d741",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b92e3e8f209d9d6a8b14d0fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "先にコースの具合は確かめてきた。\r\n指示をもらえれば、\r\nすぐに走りだせそうだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4995511abb1427498be9c3a544f8e918bd53bce44f3be0c122ebe3fba118657",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ee7ed531c91becaf2f77283f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…何人か、足を止めてこちらを\r\n見ているようだ。――力を\r\n隠すつもりはない。やろう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "80940c63c3cd06c80645e4a00d2dc00f2d5c76455daaf12f13865758d5c941fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:81743ca4a4893700ed0d1dbe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "豊富な知識と、その根性…\r\n君がウマ娘だったら、私の\r\n手強いライバルになっただろうな。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86cfb9bef8e2bbd40c598b748e636cddb9cb49be70cbbe5b48c48b9575f47fa7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd1efa4f355a8e273a4aa667",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君は、得意なスポーツはあるのか？\r\n…一緒に走ることは難しいが、もし\r\n共に打ち込めるものがあれば。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b935db1fb1c1b6f2ade1f166b72f72051046b53560fc3305c89cd6b2f65e37c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bcf2c794e152682d62b6bd80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…一種のルーティン化だろうか。\r\nこの光景が馴染んで、自主練中も、\r\nいない君のことを呼んでしまった…",
      "source_fingerprint": "7eda1c9114a1b07fb955755feace8b9b9bc63c4c68c39728cac28a38a9158380",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d71dc260780c0690cf488ef5",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "砂浜での効率的なトレーニング法は\r\n頭に入れてきた。君のメニューを、\r\n最大限吸収できるように。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4117993f0466d352bf50734cd2d33975fd0d13b21721c2652a974e264bfc39a1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1dca329c65721b28379f894d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一族に誇りたい。この結果と、君のことを。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cc889f469f86e043149bad3ee4140626b0da9c779e30d2ca5987808859a04520",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:85b01b3eab897640bb78d918",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君と共に刻んだ功績だ。…ありがとう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "020c7ed6167eedbb159e6cb4bb524a469b914359478023f1edbdeba4fd1f720b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47b61904249ceecd3dabebf2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听说收集照片的话，谢礼也会增加。嗯……\r\n下一场比赛，我想让你来为我拍。我必将拿下胜利。",
      "source_fingerprint": "91dd1b507b98b3cc4eb62aaa8467f03e80a6b6302baddcec0893fddcd120b589",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "940000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40227ad5277d32872d8ce08b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "谢谢你的协助，看来谢礼也很丰厚。\r\n还有这些照片。……翻看回顾的时间，恐怕会变得很长了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "497a2203f20c2b288557bc3cf75ac43a2b7c0523d4b3118dec5c9ee55432bd0c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "940001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ac05e32d105fadea3b0c647",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "高みへ、そして最強へ――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec71e09fdec9b39772819da0f818a57bf2ad73a0ef1e4de43b60842c98735c94",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:353880cdc4e8203792a7278f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "強くあらねば。より、強く…！",
      "source_fingerprint": "232e86280eb927ac3b717523733c28597a01e328768daefa9b0bd9f5266e8c19",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:042583ead99553700812d6a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "ああ、ドゥラメンテだ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a9b2bba89875dc1a4bd91876b24a03a385e79df0090e40c21e542b7299ccc323",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c026b329774beedd2108cdf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "荒々しくも、気高く――\r\n最強を、示そう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae465e315a129a003e22b7a5b5dc43ece289372dcbb29a3c47535fd94efdeedd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a11976c28e954f973ee37bac",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "君も、力を求めるか…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dd2ae4ebb84466e4d89b6e2d72518951baf4d67fbf5428429e306d88323f76f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eb135802d75a8b4f99c3e717",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "より激しく高めあおう。",
      "source_fingerprint": "32332d03b64a4dd8558cb394f85ae4c51f85b9718814ddf888dc187cf5b7f123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1108",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2cd74cb30099948e10525c6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好了，出发吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95ef3b7ecf7b554f835c7c37f5680de67f6628381e334b08237939214f949fe8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:33d7b2699d1d497c642019fb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你让我见识到的梦想。\r\n今后两人一起去实现吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ecaf63a9ddcd7b35a372793186193b512afd324e40cb1866fada9562ce0f2f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:59ca8bd611a716f4fef25fcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3526ad293faaba2bbb60e92f2aa2f0ce80200789aaddb5c16e63e30f50a9723c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12217a7b0ef6081b84dadb94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f3f071de3a132d55ed31edf557b362afda8ef29b618fd0f52a13920ed7d26bb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1109",
        "100001"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
